Verdict: NOT_SUPPORTED
Rationale: The claim states that TMNT is based on a film which was Mako's final film role. While evidence supports that TMNT is based on a 2007 film and that Mako's final film role was as Iroh in Avatar: The Last Airbender (2005–06), there is no evidence that the 2007 TMNT film is the same as the film in which Mako played his final role. These are two distinct films, and the claim is contradicted by this inconsistency.
